WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Ben: Welcome to the quarter close. Our summary: Revenue is ahead of plan by 6 percent, mainly from weekend trade.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Ben: Revenue for September was 118,000 pounds against a plan of 111,000.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Chris: Waste fell from 7 percent to 5 percent of bakery output.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Ben: Labour cost rose 2 points because of the new weekend shifts.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Chris: Decision: Keep the weekend shift pattern until the next review.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:56.000
Ben: Action: Review the weekend shift cost. Please confirm by Friday.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:11.000
Ben: Action: Share the waste figures with the shop managers. Please confirm by Friday.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:26.000
Chris: Thanks. Summary sent after the call.
